+   $$ \cos\theta = |\text{dot}(-\vec{d}, \text{light\_surf.ns})| $$
+6. **Calculate Directional PDF:** Combine selection probability, area PDF, and geometric term [S1, unofficial].
    $$ p(\vec{d}) = p_{light} \cdot \frac{d^2}{\cos\theta} \cdot p_{surf} $$
